{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is wrong with this city but people keep ignoring all the wicked and evil things going on around them and pretending everything is fine. Tired of this nonsense, a nameless person decides it\u2019s time to get out of here before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have 4 days to gather all the relevant documents you need to run away from this cursed city and start over in a more peaceful place. In the final game you will be able to visit a local college, a factory, a hospital, a church and more but this <strong>DEMO</strong> will be limited to the factory only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630460/extras/vsPlague.png?t=1745166995\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During combat, you can make use of up to 12 different abilities that appear as boxes surrounding your character to deal damage, dodge, parry, heal and more. Watch out for the enemies' attacks as they don't wait for you to be ready like in a classic turn-based combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630460/extras/image_2025-04-03_174558432.png?t=1745166995\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630460/extras/image_2025-04-03_175001981.png?t=1745166995\" />Interact with NPCs, buy resources, unlock new abilities and keep moving forward to reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630460?t=1745166995","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou